          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On November 10, 2009, around 8:30 PM, a witness observed a large circular light in the clouds. An airplane appeared to veer to avoid the light, which suddenly disappeared. The witness did not wish to provide additional information by testifying at the gendarmerie. The airplane's observed movement is likely following a normal air corridor (near the airport). No other testimony was collected on this phenomenon, for which we lack information.",
